# Mechanic: Activated abilities follow the current transformed face.
# Forcing: One life-gain activation reaches the transformation threshold.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield permit predictable turn progression.
# Failure modes: A life-loss offer before transformation exposes the other face.
# Card roles: Chalice provides the independent transform control.
# Protocol path: ActionsAvailableReq, activation, transformation, player targeting.
